        <tr><td>Form field</td><td><label class="form-label" for="UxDemoField">Label (always visible)</label><span class="form-hint">Hint text, linked with aria-describedby</span><input class="form-control" id="UxDemoField" value="Sample value"></td><td>Label + hint + error are programmatically linked; the error summary links back to the field.</td></tr>
